        {
          number: '02',
          title: 'Belonging can’t land',
          text: 'That’s why belonging can’t be assigned. Schools work hard to build connection, and connection matters enormously: students who feel connected at school report poor mental health at roughly half the rate of students who don’t. But a child whose threat detection is miscalibrated cannot perceive the safety a school is offering. Safety is not a feeling adults can hand to a student. It’s a reading their nervous system has to be able to make.',
